  "goodToKnow": "Der Interessent is not just anyone who is interested, it's a prospective customer or applicant: Es gibt zehn Interessenten für das Auto. It's a weak noun (den Interessenten, dem Interessenten), and the female form is die Interessentin. Wohnungsanzeigen end with Interessenten melden sich bitte unter … Don't confuse it with das Interesse (interest), which is a neuter noun, and die Interessengemeinschaft (a community of shared interests)."
